{"version":1,"content":"<p>土耳其政府周三（14日）採取行動，派警員突擊搜查全國收視率最高的新聞頻道Halk TV，中斷其直播並指派政府委任的管理人員接管，此舉引發反對派與人權組織強烈批評，電視台形容這是「土耳其黑暗一天」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.514633+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T10:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:57:39.105314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416436+00:00","content_hash":"c9fa6607fc7e56255375aa92a1161bb9a406f80b6dd460171f1770786d2cbda2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}